window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Raven Fielding isn’t your average college student. Being able to start objects on fire with the flick of his mind? Yep, not normal.</p> <p>But the person who is normal is Grace Anderson—the straight-laced, straight-A, college student Raven’s been crushing on for more months than he’d like to admit.</p> <p>Determined to win Grace’s heart, Raven accompanies her on a remote trip to see her family in Wyoming’s wilderness.</p> <p>But the trip doesn’t go as planned.</p> <p>When ghosts from Grace’s past return to derail her carefully organized life, Raven knows he and his family may be the only ones to help her.</p> <p>But what he doesn’t anticipate is the extent to which Grace’s past will threaten her—and what was supposed to be a romantic weekend away turns deadly.</p> <p>Don't miss out on the final book in this captivating YA Science Fantasy series. Download now!</p>"; 
